      "content": "i dont have login access for you here but the dashboard shows the shipment from the SEA hub is sitting at a 'pending verification' status. i'm assuming that means it's basically in the warehouse and ready to go? just need to know if we're looking at huge volumes or a smaller initial batch so i can frame the scarcity/availability correctly in the announcement.",
